{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Fully detach map keys and enums**\n\nThe copy still shares every map key and enum instance. A custom exporter can reach these through a wire map and mutate a key or a mutable enum field, changing the original record subsequently copied for later exporters. Convert enums to detached JSON scalars and copy keys using the mapper\u2019s key-serialization semantics; add mutable-key and mutable-enum isolation tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7sNGBM","finding_digest":"8e6c376214265f1d40c1c7b6864d97136c58335d2d618a641524f1e001a94dd8","finding_id":"arf_v1_rzwdoyquezpr2qgby63imtmxcn","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsightrecord.java::operations::exporter-mutation-isolation","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsightrecord.java::operations::exporter-mutation-isolation","line":66,"observation_digest":"93c83848ae497d87ed39bf2d2d3bb5162a3439f627938d3a7c109813b30b8bcd","observation_id":"aro_v1_spedqsfojf6yp3jzx4ws2o5vcy","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/Json.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_rzwdoyquezpr2qgby63imtmxcn","published_at":"2026-09-08T22:32:06Z","review_id":"arr_v1_2uiyk56mbx65mvlox4bqoub2i7","reviewed_base_sha":"a28d2262c18a8a1f1b7cc7296cf2bfd166e6ca94","reviewed_head_sha":"fe682327e1d3a6d0b6defad4684bab8d594438b5","reviewer":"codex","start_line":60,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_mpixetxctnhrwxupxbyp333ul6","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-08T22:32:06Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
